# DEPRECATED — the Worker moved to telegramworker/wrangler.jsonc.
#
# Deploy and configure the live-chat Worker from the repository root's
# `telegramworker/` directory:
#   cd telegramworker
#   wrangler d1 execute pnara_chat --file=./migrations/0001_chat_init.sql
#   wrangler secret put TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
#   wrangler secret put TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   wrangler deploy
#
# This file is kept only so old checkouts fail with an explanation instead of
# a missing-file error. Do not create a wrangler.toml here.
